      "activityContent": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">收录要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">备课资源需符合最新课程标准及最新教材使用情况，</span> <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">有一定教学参考价值，陈旧资源、旧版资源不收录。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\">1. 课件、教案/教学设计、学案/导学案等，内容结构完整,对于备课教学具有参考价值, ppt或word需可编辑,不能全部为截图。</p>\n<p class=\"p\">2. 素材类：画面清晰、无版权隐患内容。</p>\n<p class=\"p\">3. 试题要标明清楚试题出处与对应年份,每道题目必须是纯WORD文字版且有答案,为方便用户使用，需要空白的原卷在前面,答案(解析)放在后面。</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一、资源类型</span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 10.2773%;\"><col style=\"width: 89.7227%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"center\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"12.6000%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">类型</span></strong></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"center\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"87.4000%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">说</span> <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">明</span></strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"center\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"12.6000%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">课件</span></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"center\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"87.4000%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">PPT格式的同步教学资源或复习备考类资源，可包含配套使用的音视频等素材</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"center\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"12.6000%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">教案</span></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"center\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"87.4000%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">讲义、教学设计、学历案、作业设计方案</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"center\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"12.6000%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">学案</span></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"center\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"87.4000%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">导学案、学习任务单、知识清单、实验报告单</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"center\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"12.6000%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">作业</span></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"center\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"87.4000%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">同步练、单元卷、周测</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"center\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"12.6000%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">试卷</span></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"center\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"87.4000%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">PPT格式的同步教学资源或复习备考类资源</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"center\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"12.6000%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">题集</span></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"center\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"87.4000%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">试题汇编、专项训练、综合训练</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"center\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"12.6000%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">素材</span></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"center\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"87.4000%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">音频、视频、图片、动画</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"center\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"12.6000%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">备课包</span></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"center\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"87.4000%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">课件、教案、学案、习题等不同类型的资料压缩包</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">二、奖励规则</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">第</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">1重奖励：基础通过奖励：</span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 33.279%;\"><col style=\"width: 38.6623%;\"><col style=\"width: 28.0587%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"center\" nowrap=